\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Rates of transfer between states are given by a matrix with elements 
\begin_inset Formula $q_{ij}$
\end_inset

 for transfer between 
\begin_inset Formula $i$
\end_inset

 and 
\begin_inset Formula $j$
\end_inset

.
 Global balance equations give
\begin_inset Formula \[
