\begin_layout Enumerate
The queue is FIFO queue, 
\emph on
i.e.
 
\emph default
customers are served in the order they arrive.
 This assumption may be relaxed but it will simplify our proof.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Enumerate
The arrival times are statistically independent of the service times.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Enumerate
The service time distribution has a variance which is finite.
\end_layout

\end_deeper
